# Story page: nm-chaos
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Sugar High
---
Apples again, but wrong, the way a song is wrong when it is played slightly too fast. Each bite made {name} quicker, and quicker still.

The world blurred. Time bent. Somewhere a clock gave up entirely and went to live by the sea.

{name} found it could outrun its own thoughts. This is not as enjoyable as it sounds. I tried it once, in my youth, and I am still waiting for some of them to catch up.
